=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} in {z:Bastok Markets (S)} (H-6).
* Examine the **???** at {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} (F-6) for a cutscene.
** Located just east of the bridge
** {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)}, or {p:Atmacite Refiner} are quickest ways.
* Examine the Beastman Ensign at {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} (J-7) for a cutscene.
* Return to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} to receive a {@k}{k:Flare grenade}.
* Return to the Beastman Ensign at {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} (J-7) for another cutscene.
* Examine the Beastman Ensign again to start a BC fight against an {m:Arch Ahriman}.
** This fight is easily won with lvl 99 and trusts.
** During the battle, the NM will vanish and a replica of {p:Volker}, {n:Five Moons}, or Nicolaus will appear in its stead. When the replica is defeated, the Ahriman will reappear.
** In one battle the pattern was Arch Ahriman > Volker > Arch Ahriman > Five Moons > Arch Ahriman > Nicolaus > Arch Ahriman.
** The replicas use weapon skills based on their equipped weapons. The Ahriman and Nicolaus replica will cast spells, including high-level AoE spells such as {s:Sleepga II}, Blindga, and {s:Poisonga II}.
** As of Jan 4, 2021, this battle can end after killing a single Arch Ahriman without fighting any replicas.
* Speak to {p:Gentle Tiger|Gentle Tiger (S)} for a cutscene and your reward.
** If you don't have the {i:Elixir|Elixir|4145} reward from {q:Burden of Suspicion|Burden of Suspicion|Burden of Suspicion}, this is another chance - keep this {i:Elixir Tank|Elixir Tank|16249} for later use in {q:The Truth Lies Hid|The Truth Lies Hid|The Truth Lies Hid}.

If you are working on missions then return to {M:Crossroads of Time|Crossroads of Time|Crossroads of Time}.
